"outputs/a5d43b4c-c538-4f34-8cf3-92c2c0d26fdd-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/classical-"
"feedforward-and-control-flow/extracted-"
"outputs/a5d43b4c-c538-4f34-8cf3-92c2c0d26fdd-0.avif)\n"

